message: "If you use Richardson Attention (Superconducting Spectral Attention) in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Richardson Attention: Superconducting Spectral Attention and Renormalization Group Relays for Zero-Shot Multi-Hop Extrapolation in Pre-Trained Transformers"
authors:
  - family-names: "Walters"
    given-names: "James F."
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-04-17"
url: "https://github.com/tryggth/richardson-attention"
repository-code: "https://github.com/tryggth/richardson-attention"
keywords:
  - "transformers"
  - "attention-mechanism"
  - "long-context"
  - "multi-hop-reasoning"
  - "gemma-4"
